    <section class="features" id="features">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="features-content">
                <div class="slider-content">
                    <div class="slide-left wowo fadeInUp">
                        <div class="sub-title">FEATURES</div>
                        <h2>This is the future of design. </h2>
                        <ul>
                            <li class="active"><span class="num">01.</span>Fastest design tool</li>
                            <li><span class="num">02.</span>Branded</li>
                            <li><span class="num">03.</span>Ready to use posts</li>
                            <li><span class="num">04.</span>Free photos</li>
                            <li><span class="num">05.</span>Easy editor</li>
                            <li><span class="num">06.</span>All sizes</li>
                            <li><span class="num">07.</span>All events</li>
                            <li><span class="num">08.</span>Social Media Scheduling </li>
                            <!-- <li><span class="num">09.</span>Two easy ways</li> -->
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="slide-right wowo fadeInUp">
                        <div class="features-slider-box" id="slider">
                            <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/fast.jpg?1" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>Type text and the bot spits out beautiful designs based on your brand.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/branded.jpg?1" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>All designs are created uniquely for your brand, using your logo, colors, and fonts.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/tamplates.jpg?1" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>Choose a ready to use branded post, just download it and post it.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/unsplash.jpg?1" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>Free photos-With Unsplash integrated, you get a world of royalty-free stock and lifestyle photos at your fingertips</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/editor.jpg?1" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>Easy editor-Zero design or graphic skills necessary. All you need is 18 seconds or less.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/sizes.jpg?2" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>All sizes- Get the same look across multiple platforms, for seamless marketing.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/events.jpg?1" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>All events - Tell the bot exactly what you need, whether it’s a  sale, a birthday greeting, or a new blog post.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/buffer.jpg?1" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>Social Media Scheduling - Schedule with buffer without leaving Prettyclose. It really is that easy to start getting likes.</p>
                            </div>
                            <!-- <div class="item">
                                <div class="img-box">
                                    <img src="/site_static/images/features/easyway.jpg" alt="">
                                </div>
                                <p>Two easy ways- Either customize an existing template or let the bot start from scratch. Either way it’s all about your brand.</p>
                            </div> -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="features-bottom wowo fadeInUp">
                    <a href="#" class="btn-a"><%=signup_text%></a>
                    <div class="dividing-line"></div>
                    <div class="slick-arrow">
                        <a href="#" class="icon-arrow-right2 icon-arrow-prev arrow-prev"></a>
                        <a href="#" class="icon-arrow-right2 icon-arrow-next arrow-next"></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="works">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="wowo fadeInUp">How It Works</h2>
            <div class="content">
                
                <div class="item wowo fadeInUp">
                    <div class="img-box">
                        <img src="/site_static/images/works-list-02.svg" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="text">
                        <h3>Upload your brand.</h3>
                        <p>Upload your brand logo and colors when you create your account.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="item wowo fadeInUp">
                    <div class="img-box">
                        <img src="/site_static/images/works-list-01.svg" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="text">
                        <h3>Tell us what you need.</h3>
