                        <img src="/site_static/images/works-list-03.svg" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="text">
                        <h3>Design in seconds.</h3>
                        <p>You'll get custom branded posts designed in seconds!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="btn-main wowo fadeInUp">
                <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="video-link embed btn-a">Watch video <i></i></a>
               
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="design-philosophy">
        <h2 class="wowo fadeInUp">Facts we proved false.</h2>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="slider-box">
                <div class="item wowo fadeInUp">
                    <div class="item-main">
                        <div class="item-bg">
                            <h3>01</h3>
                            <h4>Good design takes a long times.</h4>
                            <p>Create high quality design within 18 seconds.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="item wowo fadeInUp">
                    <div class="item-main">
                        <div class="item-bg">
                            <h3>02</h3>
                            <h4>Businesses that post quality posts daily have an inhouse design team.</h4>
                            <p>No, it might actually be the CEO during her morning commute.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="item wowo fadeInUp">
                    <div class="item-main">
                        <div class="item-bg">
                            <h3>03</h3>
                            <h4>Professional design is expensive.</h4>
                            <p>Or it can cost you $36</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="item wowo fadeInUp">
                    <div class="item-main">
                        <div class="item-bg">
                            <h3>04</h3>
                            <h4>It's either boring, reused templates or expensive, unique content.</h4>
                            <p>Nope, our designs and templates are branded so well that you will constantly stick in people’s minds.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="item wowo fadeInUp">
                    <div class="item-main">
                        <div class="item-bg">
                            <h3>05</h3>
                            <h4>You will always see a difference between a template and a design agency.</h4>
                            <p>Hundreds of businesses testify that there is no difference between a Pretty Smart template and work designed by a professional designer.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
