                        your brand and are like none other. This is lightyears ahead of a DIY template.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="img-box wowo fadeInUp animated">
                    <img src="/site_static/images/text-and-images-group-02.png?2" alt="">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="content-module">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="content">
                <div class="content-list wowo fadeInUp">
                    <h2>Smart Bot</h2>
                    <p>Tell us what you need and the bot will make it for you instantly, perfectly customized to fit
                        your brand!</p>
                    <a href="#" class="btn-a btn-form" data-link="<%=signup_link%>">
                        <span class="hide-on-hover">Go Pretty, go!</span>
